      "content": "Hi, I'm preparing for a meeting with a new raw material supplier for our manufacturing plant in Munich. We're looking to draft a master service agreement (MSA). Can you provide a checklist of standard terms and conditions we should include to protect ourselves against supply chain volatility and sudden price fluctuations?",
